{"story":{"id":"story-a9bb1a7a63a447b0","title":{"zh":"行商","en":"The Caravaneers"},"category":"society","image":"art/b7ef4b47c87fbcb9cdc6.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.75","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们已经成功地破译了[This.ContactCountry.GetName]向我们发送的令人困惑的重复信息，我们发现这些信息是一些……商业广告！显然他们自称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，是一个以向偶遇的任何文明提供最优惠的交易谋生的星际商团的一部分，至少他们自称是最优惠的。一如既往，他们似乎正在尝试联系我们。","en":"We have managed to decipher the confusing, repetitive messages the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] were sending us, and it turns out that they were... commercial advertisements! Apparently they call themselves [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and are part of a "},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact_critters.75"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.75","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.75","title":{"zh":"行商","en":"The Caravaneers"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们已经成功地破译了[This.ContactCountry.GetName]向我们发送的令人困惑的重复信息，我们发现这些信息是一些……商业广告！显然他们自称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，是一个以向偶遇的任何文明提供最优惠的交易谋生的星际商团的一部分，至少他们自称是最优惠的。一如既往，他们似乎正在尝试联系我们。","en":"We have managed to decipher the confusing, repetitive messages the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] were sending us, and it turns out that they were... commercial advertisements! Apparently they call themselves [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and are part of a group of spacefaring traders that make a living by offering the best deals - or what they claim to be the best deals - to whichever civilization they happen to be visiting at the time. True to form, it appears they are attempting to contact us."},{"zh":"我们已经成功地破译了[This.ContactCountry.GetName]向我们发送的，一遍又一遍的，令人困惑的信息，我们发现这些信息竟是一些……商业广告！似乎[This.System.GetName]恒星系是一个自称[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]的星际商团的母星系。显然，他们以向偶遇的任何文明提供最优惠的交易谋生，至少他们自称是最优惠的。","en":"We have managed to decipher the confusing, repetitive messages the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] were sending us, and it turns out that they were... commercial advertisements! It appears that the [This.System.GetName] system is the home system of a group of spacefaring traders that call themselves the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. They apparently make a living by offering the best deals - or what they claim to be the best deals - to whichever civilization they happen to be visiting at the time."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":"art/b7ef4b47c87fbcb9cdc6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"显示在屏幕上。","en":"On screen."},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84a703"},{"target":"first_contact.1105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-f4810be797c73d62"},{"target":"first_contact.1110","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-4c442c803066d8b5"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_fruitful"},{"target":"cara.1020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-d7b8fcad4ef27504"},{"target":"cara.2020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-c9b49b23ac539406"},{"target":"cara.3020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-2bb89e85cc3f8c94"},{"target":"marauder.15","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_heirs_of_the_khan"},{"target":"leviathans.102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-80b79499ff487797"},{"target":"leviathans.301","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.295","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.502","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-7955ff16d7a36494"},{"target":"enclave.205","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_shroudwalker_apprentice"},{"target":"enclave.305",